ind":"update","title":"Beta 0.0.426 Update","summary":"Bug FixesFixed movement input getting stuck in one direction after opening or closing the friend invite window.Fixed an issue where AI mode could not be selected after opening the friend invite window until leaving the room.Fixed localization keys appearing in achievement notifications for the first win and first loss.Added missing notification translations in all 12 supported languages, including the achievement for launching the game 100 times.Fixed destructible blocks obscuring penguins and t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:40:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696201","verified_at":"2026-10-21T06:22:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599540-1846018067944580","game_id":"steam-4599540","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta 0.0.424 업데이트","summary":"Upgrade ChangesAdditional Shot / Piercing Bullet: Added +50% Ammo to Additional Shot. Piercing Bullet now grants +30% Range and -10% Bullet Speed instead of bonus Weapon Damage.Nine Lives: Reduced post-revival invincibility to 0.25 seconds.Pistols: Moved to the Utility category. Six pistols are thrown simultaneously during Ready, spinning outward with varied directions and distances before landing. Added minimum placement spacing and removed the deployment-count buff icon. Received bullets now i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T16:00:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944580","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599540-1846018067938749","game_id":"steam-4599540","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta 0.0.422","summary":"Stats and Upgrade DescriptionsFixed stat values now use benefit or drawback colors compared with current stats. Equal values remain white.Selected damage and count formulas now display calculated values in in-game upgrade descriptions. The encyclopedia retains the original formulas.Fixed card tooltips being obscured by the owned-upgrade list.Increased the normal-mode recommendation step from 5% to 7% per upgrade. Recommendation name colors remain exclusive to test mode.Combat and FixesImproved d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T15:40:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938749","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599540-1846018067937852","game_id":"steam-4599540","kind":"update","title":"Logo Update","summary":"Logo UpdateUpdated the in-game logo.The new logo will also be rolled out across the Steam store page soon.Balance ChangesStress Relief: Changed the maximum health penalty from -10% to -30%, and healing per destroyed terrain block from 1 to 0.5.Expanding Bullet: Reduced the bullet speed penalty from -40% to -25%.Rock: Reduced movement-based ammo recovery speed by 15%.UI and FixesReloading now displays a reload icon and a fixed-size red circular progress gauge.Added mouse-wheel scrolling to key bi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T05:50:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937852","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599540-1845383656397026","game_id":"steam-4599540","kind":"update","title":"Beta 0.0.420 Update","summary":"Stats UISplit stats into 6 core stats and 9 additional stats.Core stats are shown by default. Additional stats can be expanded using the side button.Updated stat icons and display order.Stat details now appear beside the mouse cursor.Added stat names to the center upgrade card and encyclopedia detail view.Upgrade stats are displayed in this order: fixed values → benefits → drawbacks.Fixed values use bold numbers in square brackets, with spacing between benefits and drawbacks.Darkened tooltip bac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T16:30:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397026","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599540-1844751498230107","game_id":"steam-4599540","kind":"update","title":"Beta 0.0.414 Patch Notes","summary":"Added damage-scaled projectile trails and a health-loss animation after taking damage.Added a screen-edge warning when health is low.Unified upgrade descriptions across selection cards, the top-right tooltip, and the encyclopedia.Changed the encyclopedia to four cards per row, with stat icons and values to the left of each card.Fixed the main menu version label showing “Customize.”","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T23:49:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230107","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599540-1844751498226950","game_id":"steam-4599540","kind":"update","title":"Beta 0.0.413 Update","summary":"Upgrade cards now move so the card you’re viewing stays in the center. Stat changes appear on the left, while additional effects and synergies appear on the right.New map layouts have been added with symmetry, movement routes, and cover in mind. Cover prevents players from landing a direct shot immediately after spawning.We also refined existing upgrades, including the Bat, Rock, and Throwing Axe, and fixed several issues with their behavior and effects. The regular and beta upgrade pools contai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T10:30:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226950","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599540-1843481262691205","game_id":"steam-4599540","kind":"update","title":"Beta 0.0.411 Update","summary":"Reduced the overall effectiveness of the 'Airstrike Designator'.Reduced its targeting marker speed and maximum targeting range.Increased its strike delay and post-fire targeting pause.Adjusted the charge stat range of the 'Harpoon' to -25%–+100%.The 'Harpoon' charge-size animation is now visible to opposing players.Upgrades obtained through 'Gamble!' now display the localized 'Gamble!' name before the resulting upgrade name.Changed the 'SMG' bullet damage to 0.5 and attack delay to 0.05.Fixed mi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T05:39:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691205","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599540-1843481262691108","game_id":"steam-4599540","kind":"update","title":"Demo Achievement Update","summary":"The demo now includes 12 Steam achievements based on match records and various combat actions. These range from earning your first victory to completing special challenges that unlock new upgrades.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T04:30:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691108","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599540-1843481262691013","game_id":"steam-4599540","kind":"announcement","title":"Achievement Fixes","summary":"Fixed an issue where match results and certain achievements were not properly registered on Steam. Synchronization has also been improved so achievements already completed in-game can be submitted to Steam again.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T03:29:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691013","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599540-1842846814456207","game_id":"steam-4599540","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo New Upgrades!","summary":"These are the major changes implemented between August 25 and September 9.This update includes new weapons and upgrades, combat system improvements, and fixes for network and terrain-related issues. New WeaponsThrowing Axe has been added.It bounces off terrain multiple times and embeds itself in enemies, stacking a gravity effect on them.Rock has been added.It restores ammo based on the distance traveled and randomly appears as one of several visual variants.Bat has been added.It attacks in fron","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T16:30:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814456207","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4599540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:14:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:14:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4599540":"2026-10-26T03:14:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4599540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:14:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:14:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4666170":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:14:16Z","last_success_at":"20